  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till n&#xe4;tverk mellan tj&#xe4;nstem&#xe4;n i 10 l&#xe4;nder i Sydostasien samt 2 i-l&#xe4;nder ansvariga f&#xf6;r avvecklingen av ozonnedbrytande substanser. UNEP &#xe4;r genomf&#xf6;rare av insatsen. St&#xf6;det p&#xe5;g&#xe5;tt sedan 1993, tidigare genomf&#xf6;rt med SEI som svensk koordinator inom ramen f&#xf6;r programmet f&#xf6;ratmosf&#xe4;rsfr&#xe5;gor i utvecklingl&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to network between government officials in 10 countries in South East Asia and 2 developed countries responsible for the phaseoutof ozon depleting substances. UNEP is the implementing agency. Sida has been supporting this programme since 1993. Until this programme period SEI has been the swedish koordinator (atmospheric issues prog.)</narrative>
